---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="relative z-10 border-t border-emerald-500/20 bg-zinc-950/95 mt-24">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-10">
      
      <!-- Brand & Community Info -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-zinc-900 border border-emerald-500/30 flex items-center justify-center p-1 shadow-emerald-glow">
            <img
              src="/images/branding/logo-emerald-city-128.png"
              alt="Emerald City Logo"
              class="w-full h-full object-contain"
            />
          </div>
          <span class="text-xl font-black uppercase tracking-wider">
            Emerald<span class="text-emerald-400">City</span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm max-w-md leading-relaxed">
          Comunidad oficial de Pokémon GO en Caracas, Venezuela. Inspirados en el poder de Rayquaza para unir entrenadores en quedadas, Community Days, incursiones legendarias y torneos.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-2">
          <a
            href="https://instagram.com/emeraldcityccs"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 text-pink-400 hover:border-pink-500/40 transition-colors"
          >
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5" />
              <path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z" />
              <line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5" />
            </svg>
            @emeraldcityccs
          </a>
          <span class="text-xs text-zinc-500">Caracas, Venezuela</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Links -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">
          Explorar
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-zinc-400">
          <li>
            <a href="/" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Inicio</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/unirse" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors font-semibold text-emerald-300">Quiero ser parte</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/noticias" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Noticias y Quedadas</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/bazar" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Bazar Emerald (3D)</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/gimmi-pass" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Gimmi Pass</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/amigos" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Haz amigos Pokémon</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/admin/" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Panel de Administración</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Community Guidelines & Disclaimer -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">
          Comunidad
        </h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
          Sitio gestionado por y para la comunidad de entrenadores de Caracas. No estamos afiliados a Nintendo, The Pokémon Company ni Niantic Labs.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 p-3 rounded-lg bg-zinc-900/60 border border-zinc-800 text-[11px] text-zinc-400">
          Pokémon y sus respectivas marcas son propiedad registrada de Nintendo, Creatures Inc. y GAME FREAK inc.
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Bar -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-zinc-800/80 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-xs text-zinc-400 gap-4">
      <p>© {currentYear} Emerald City Community. Diseñado para entrenadores de Caracas.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
        <span class="text-zinc-400">Servidores activos en Caracas (GMT-4)</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
